1
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:41,840
Zheng Yu.

2
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:49,880
You must want to know what happened
during the immunology exam.

3
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,800
I know who threw the paper ball.

4
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:02,720
I saw it.

5
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:06,760
Who?

6
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,880
We shouldn't talk here.

7
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,320
Let's go somewhere else.

8
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:17,760
I know a nice restaurant nearby.
It's my treat.

9
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:25,560
Let's talk here.

10
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:27,160
Who threw the paper ball?

11
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:29,520
I will tell you.

12
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:33,760
However, I hope
you can agree to one condition.

13
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,000
It's nothing difficult.

14
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:39,240
From now on,
I hope you won't block my calls.

15
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:43,560
I have limited call credits.
Just contact me on WeChat.

16
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:46,320
You've muted notifications
from me, haven't you?

17
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:48,160
You never reply.

18
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:56,560
UNMUTE NOTIFICATIONS

19
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,880
Now can you tell me?

20
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,000
It was Sun Dongchao.

21
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:07,880
Why would he do that?

22
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,400
To frame someone.

23
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,760
I don't get it.

24
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:14,320
I would understand
if he threw the ball at me.

25
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:17,280
What does he have against Chen Yanzhou?

26
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:23,400
So he meant to throw the paper ball at me.

27
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,080
That's right.

28
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:27,480
During exam week,

29
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:30,480
Sun Dongchao told
a few of his close friends

30
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:33,320
that he would teach you a lesson
during the final exam.

31
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,840
<i>In the end,</i>

32
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:37,080
<i>he threw it too hard.</i>

33
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:48,080
So he knew that was
a surveillance blind spot.

34
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:52,480
Our sophomore ecology course was
in that old classroom.

35
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,520
You might not remember.

36
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:58,440
Sun Dongchao was absent
more than three times.

37
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,080
Mr. Qin failed him.

38
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:01,680
I don't remember.

39
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,560
Sun Dongchao denied it,

40
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:07,400
forcing Mr. Qin to check the footage
to prove his absences.

41
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:10,480
Turns out the classroom surveillance
has a blind spot.

42
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,080
He got away with it.

43
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:20,360
If not for fear that people would use this
to ruin your competition chances,

44
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:21,920
I wouldn't have revealed this.

45
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:26,360
Chen Yanzhou offers bribes
and uses his connections.

46
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:29,680
What becomes of him is none of my concern.

47
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,920
So that text was from you.

48
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,680
I just saw it by chance.

49
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,200
<i>If it wasn't anonymous,</i>

50
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:46,520
would you have listened to me?

51
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:48,240
It was for your own good.

52
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:51,440
Really? Good in what way?

53
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:57,480
When Sun Dongchao
called me a pushover in the dorm,

54
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,800
you ran over to tell me.

55
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:01,440
When he wanted to frame me,

56
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:03,120
why didn't you warn me?

57
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:05,840
Or is it that

58
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:08,000
you wanted to see me framed,

59
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:10,440
see me fail,

60
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:11,800
and then play the hero?

61
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,120
Zheng Yu,

62
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:16,480
you're really overthinking it.

63
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:21,840
I thought he was just bluffing.
I didn't think he would follow through.

64
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:27,160
I'd like to think you're better than this.

65
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:33,920
But the thought of Sun Dongchao
getting away with it

66
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,560
and enjoying his winter break

67
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,680
doesn't sit well with me.

68
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,880
Don't worry.

69
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:42,880
I will tell everything to the advisor

70
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:45,160
and make him pay the price.

71
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,520
Do it now.

72
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,240
I need to see her anyway.

73
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:51,840
Zheng Yu,

74
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:55,880
do you not trust me,
or do you want to keep an eye on me?

75
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:59,520
I have to turn in my financial aid
verification form.

76
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:02,160
My financial aid is
far more important than this.

77
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,960
Let's go.

78
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:14,240
So Sun Dongchao originally meant
to throw the paper ball to Zheng Yu.

79
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:20,120
Why didn't you tell me
when I asked you about this before?

80
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:24,480
Sun Dongchao warned everyone not to tell.

81
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:30,400
But I don't want him to escape punishment.

82
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,240
What if he does worse later?

83
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:34,280
So after thinking about it,

84
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:36,040
I decided to come forward.

85
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:39,080
Got it.

86
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:44,760
However, right now,

87
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:47,320
it's just your testimony.

88
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:50,520
If Sun Dongchao doesn't admit it,
our hands will still be tied.

89
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:53,560
Others in the class heard him say it.

90
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:56,160
If necessary,
I can help get in touch with them.

91
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:01,480
2024 FALL SEMESTER EXAM SEATING CHART

92
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:05,760
On the day of the exam,
was the rear door left open?

93
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,600
I'll top up your phone.

94
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:15,320
Zheng Yu, what do you need?

95
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,680
I'm turning in my form.

96
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:18,800
Put it on my desk.

97
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:24,360
I was quite worried
that you were too withdrawn.

98
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:28,320
Now I'm glad to see you
and Xie Yudi getting along so well.

99
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,000
He and I have no relationship.

100
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,840
I said too much.

101
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,440
I have to get going.

102
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:38,480
Just put the form on my desk.

103
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:57,720
FROM: ZHENG YU
SUMMARY OF NETWORKING EVENT

104
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:15,720
UNIVERSITY FINANCIAL AID VERIFICATION FORM
STUDENT: ZHENG YU

105
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:18,000
MOM IN VEGETATIVE STATE, NO INCOME

106
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:22,280
MOM WAS SEVERELY INJURED IN A CAR CRASH

107
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,920
TREATMENT USED UP ALL SAVINGS

108
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,600
NO ASSETS
NO RELATIVES PROVIDING AID

109
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,760
- You--
- Shut up.

110
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:55,200
<i>Chen Yanzhou, are you at the campus?</i>

111
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:57,560
<i>There has been a conclusion</i>
<i>to the cheating incident.</i>

112
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:09,800
T5-201 CORRIDOR-01

113
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:14,040
Did Sun Dongchao admit it?

114
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,680
When he got the call from me,

115
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,200
he confessed everything.

116
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:18,520
He may have done this,

117
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,760
but he has very little guts.

118
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,920
Besides, the timing matches up.

119
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:26,880
Tomorrow, the university
will issue a statement

120
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,400
to clear your name

121
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:31,800
and disclose the disciplinary action
against Sun Dongchao.

122
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:34,560
Sorry for the trouble lately.

123
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,400
I didn't do much.

124
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:38,600
You should thank Xie Yudi.

125
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:41,920
Xie Yudi?

126
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,920
How long have you been in this class?

127
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,960
Don't tell me you don't know who he is.

128
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:49,800
I think I vaguely know who he is.

129
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:52,160
I just don't understand why he helped me.

130
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,920
That's because…

131
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,160
<i>He and I have no relationship.</i>

132
00:09:57,240 --> 00:10:00,520
That's because you're all classmates.
Helping each other is normal.

133
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:06,600
Miss, when will the award money be issued?

134
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:08,600
Do you mean the Vitality Award?

135
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:09,960
The teachers are on break.

136
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:12,160
It won't be until next semester.

137
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,280
Don't worry.

138
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:15,560
You're securely in the number one spot.

139
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,240
I mean the first-class scholarship.

140
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:20,800
That's also postponed.

141
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:23,600
You've never cared about the money.

142
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,360
What if someone needs money?

143
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,600
What did you say?

144
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:31,640
Nothing.

145
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,000
Well, I'm going to go now.

146
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,200
Okay.

147
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:43,320
SCHOLARSHIP AWARD CEREMONY
FOR LOW-INCOME STUDENTS

148
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:46,120
Is this photo newly put up?

149
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,080
I never noticed it.

150
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,040
It's over two years old.

151
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:53,720
You usually come here
for academic matters.

152
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:56,600
It's normal if you've never noticed it.

153
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:06,000
SCHOLARSHIP AWARD CEREMONY
FOR LOW-INCOME STUDENTS

154
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:12,760
I DIDN'T MEAN TO LOOK AT IT

155
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:20,480
Doesn't that sound too defensive?

156
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:37,480
NOW THE PE CLASS IS OVER,
I HAVEN'T HAD TIME TO DO ANY ROLLERBLADING

157
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:41,840
That seems a bit forced.

158
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,760
RECALL MESSAGE

159
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:55,040
Your dad cut up some fruit. Eat some.

160
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:59,520
I have good news.

161
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:01,920
Final grades are out.
I'm ranked first overall.

162
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:03,760
Really?

163
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,400
Unfortunately…

164
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:07,040
What's wrong?

165
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:09,840
The scholarship won't
be disbursed until next semester.

166
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:12,280
Otherwise, I could
take you out to buy a gift.

167
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,240
I thought you were
going to say something else.

168
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:19,040
All I want is for everything
to go well for you.

169
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:22,800
You've been so busy
since you returned to university.

170
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,280
Be mindful of your health.

171
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:27,360
Since you're on break,

172
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:29,600
why don't you get another checkup?

173
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:32,440
Another checkup?

174
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:33,760
See Dr. Li.

175
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:35,760
Okay.

176
00:12:38,640 --> 00:12:41,440
Is there a rehab center
behind the hospital?

177
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:44,720
I think so. Why do you ask?

178
00:12:57,800 --> 00:12:58,920
Thank you.

179
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:07,040
CORE INTRODUCTION
TO REHABILITATION THERAPY

180
00:13:10,680 --> 00:13:12,080
Which ward are you going to?

181
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:14,520
I know this building well.

182
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:16,040
I don't know which ward.

183
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:18,760
Do you at least know the patient's name?

184
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:22,200
I only know the name
of the patient's family member.

185
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:02,640
I think I did something stupid.

186
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:04,920
Before coming,

187
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:08,280
I thought to buy some fruit
to visit the patient.

188
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:13,200
- But…
- It's no big deal.

189
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:17,960
I've never seen
any friends visit Xiaozheng.

190
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:21,160
If her mom is aware,

191
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:23,920
I bet your presence here

192
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:27,400
makes her happier than eating fruit.

193
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:33,000
Does Zheng Yu come every day?

194
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:34,600
Not necessarily.

195
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:37,560
When she's busy, she doesn't come often.

196
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:39,760
I haven't seen her for a few days.

197
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:43,880
I heard she didn't get some scholarship.

198
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:46,880
What was it called?

199
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,120
The Vitality Award.

200
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:55,520
She worked so hard
but ended up not getting it.

201
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:58,200
She must be terribly upset.

202
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:02,240
And that student in number one

203
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:04,480
came out of nowhere.

204
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:05,720
In the past two years,

205
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:08,200
I didn't hear her mention them.

206
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:17,000
Since Zheng Yu isn't
here today, I'll be going.

207
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:18,320
So soon?

208
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:22,160
- Thank you for showing me the way today.
- Don't mention it.

209
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:23,680
Just like Xiaozheng,

210
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:25,120
call me Ms. Yang.

211
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:27,920
Oh, right.

212
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:30,960
Ms. Yang, why don't I give this to you?

213
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,520
Thank you for your efforts.

214
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:35,440
Okay.

215
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:36,480
Well,

216
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:40,800
I guess if you take this with you,
you will probably feel bad.

217
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,520
Well then, I'm going now.

218
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:45,920
Xiaochen.

219
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:50,040
My favorite fruit

220
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,400
is actually waxberries.

221
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:56,080
Waxberries are a summer fruit
and aren't available now.

222
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:59,240
Then continue being friends
with Xiaozheng,

223
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:01,400
at least until summer.

224
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:05,400
Then I'll get to eat waxberries from you.

225
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:08,120
Come visit often.

226
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:10,760
Okay.

227
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:26,960
It's her, isn't it?

228
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:28,440
Zheng Yu.

229
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:30,200
- It's her!
- It is! Stop!

230
00:16:30,280 --> 00:16:31,240
Stop running!

231
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:32,320
Stop!

232
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:35,400
Stop!

233
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:39,880
Have a death wish?

234
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,160
- Stop!
- Sir, drive.

235
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:45,480
- Stop!
- Stop!

236
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:49,520
Goddamn it.

237
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:58,680
WU FA

238
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:04,680
<i>Zheng Yu, listen up.</i>

239
00:17:04,760 --> 00:17:05,800
<i>Running is useless.</i>

240
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:07,680
<i>I'll always find you!</i>

241
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:10,599
The 30,000 yuan disbursement is postponed.

242
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:13,079
When next semester starts,

243
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:14,640
I will send it to you in full.

244
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,839
<i>Do you think I'd still believe you?</i>

245
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:18,599
Believe what you want.

246
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,920
<i>Five days.</i>

247
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,960
<i>I will give you another five days.</i>

248
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:24,359
<i>After five days, if you're missing a cent,</i>

249
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:26,640
<i>I will pay your mother a visit.</i>

250
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:34,200
At the lab,

251
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:36,840
were you on the phone with this guy?

252
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:38,800
What?

253
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:42,080
Nothing.

254
00:17:45,040 --> 00:17:46,440
I'm warning you.

255
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:49,560
Don't tell anyone about this,

256
00:17:49,640 --> 00:17:51,640
especially people at the university.

257
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:54,000
Don't worry. I don't have time for gossip.

258
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:04,280
THE 12TH, 13TH FIVE-YEAR PLAN

259
00:18:04,360 --> 00:18:07,520
<i>She worked so hard</i>
<i>but ended up not getting it.</i>

260
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:11,400
<i>She must be terribly upset.</i>

261
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:12,920
Why were you here?

262
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:16,960
I went to get a checkup.

263
00:18:18,600 --> 00:18:20,640
- Where are you headed?
- The convenience store.

264
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:23,400
Just drop me off anywhere.

265
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:27,320
I'm going to the lab. It's on the way.

266
00:18:38,560 --> 00:18:41,720
CONFIRM ROUTE CHANGE

267
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:00,360
Continue to Lefu Yayuan.

268
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:01,360
Okay.

269
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:23,760
What the heck?

270
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:25,280
Didn't you see me here?

271
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:26,520
I…

272
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:29,560
Think you're so cool,
getting dropped off at work?

273
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:31,880
Stop thinking about slacking off.

274
00:19:37,520 --> 00:19:40,120
Can I get this month's wages in advance?

275
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:42,840
Do you have to pay on dates?

276
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:48,760
I need it urgently.

277
00:19:48,840 --> 00:19:49,840
It doesn't matter.

278
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:52,400
Even bank loans collect interest.

279
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:54,640
I run a convenience store, not a charity.

280
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:58,400
Don't assume I don't do good deeds.

281
00:19:58,480 --> 00:20:01,080
I give up my seat
and help seniors cross the street.

282
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:03,840
I do all sorts of good with one exception.

283
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:06,000
I don't do good deeds that cost money.

284
00:20:07,120 --> 00:20:08,360
I only

285
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,840
do free good deeds.

286
00:20:12,320 --> 00:20:13,160
Got it.

287
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:25,080
I can't give you an advance,

288
00:20:25,800 --> 00:20:27,280
but I can arrange more shifts.

289
00:20:27,360 --> 00:20:29,440
That will increase your income.

290
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:31,600
I won't come tomorrow. You watch the shop.

291
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:32,520
Not tomorrow.

292
00:20:32,600 --> 00:20:33,680
I have tutoring.

293
00:21:02,560 --> 00:21:04,040
Flowers cost 300 yuan.

294
00:21:04,120 --> 00:21:06,280
You sent me 300 yuan this morning.

295
00:21:06,360 --> 00:21:08,160
You're missing the errand fee.

296
00:21:08,240 --> 00:21:09,480
This is the receipt.

297
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:12,520
My phone is charging inside.

298
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:15,400
Here's a flower as payment.

299
00:21:16,560 --> 00:21:19,120
There. It costs more than 20 yuan.

300
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:23,600
Anything else?

301
00:21:24,560 --> 00:21:27,680
I tutored for ten days
this month, 40 hours in total.

302
00:21:27,760 --> 00:21:29,400
I want to settle that in advance.

303
00:21:32,280 --> 00:21:34,920
For the past half year,
all payments were monthly.

304
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:36,920
Now you suddenly propose this today.

305
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:39,120
Do you have any integrity?

306
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:41,120
You may have forgotten.

307
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:43,200
Half a year ago, we agreed on daily pay.

308
00:21:43,280 --> 00:21:45,360
I have the chat history.

309
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:47,280
You felt monthly was more convenient,

310
00:21:47,360 --> 00:21:49,040
so you unilaterally decided on it.

311
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:51,320
I urgently need money now.

312
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:54,440
This money is for my legitimate services.

313
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:57,440
Do you want to settle the score now?

314
00:21:57,520 --> 00:22:00,040
Fine. Let's make things clear.

315
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:06,920
These are all videos
of your lessons at our house.

316
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:07,840
Come take a look.

317
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:16,240
<i>You didn't inform me</i>

318
00:22:16,320 --> 00:22:17,440
about a camera.

319
00:22:17,520 --> 00:22:19,240
Why should I tell you?

320
00:22:19,320 --> 00:22:20,440
I pay for your time.

321
00:22:20,520 --> 00:22:22,200
Why can't I monitor you?

322
00:22:22,280 --> 00:22:24,520
Don't you want to
settle the score? Go ahead.

323
00:22:26,600 --> 00:22:27,480
Come on.

324
00:22:29,600 --> 00:22:30,720
On November 8th,

325
00:22:30,800 --> 00:22:33,760
you tutored for four hours
and used the toilet twice.

326
00:22:33,840 --> 00:22:35,840
Didn't I tell you before

327
00:22:35,920 --> 00:22:37,720
not to drink too much water?

328
00:22:37,800 --> 00:22:38,920
I'm a germaphobe.

329
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:41,520
I don't like others using our bathroom.

330
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:43,960
On November 23rd, at 3:15 p.m.,

331
00:22:44,040 --> 00:22:46,120
Xiaojie ate snacks in his room.

332
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:48,880
Didn't I tell you
not to let him eat that junk?

333
00:22:48,960 --> 00:22:50,480
Did you remind him?

334
00:22:51,080 --> 00:22:52,920
On November 29th, you took 15 minutes

335
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:54,160
to explain one problem.

336
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:57,880
He still didn't get it.
Shouldn't you reflect on that?

337
00:22:57,960 --> 00:23:00,920
These failures are grounds
for zero payment this month.

338
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:05,440
I can also make sure that
this area's tutoring circle shuts you out.

339
00:23:08,520 --> 00:23:09,680
Nothing to say now?

340
00:23:10,840 --> 00:23:13,120
I didn't actually want to nitpick.

341
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:16,120
If you realize your problems today,

342
00:23:16,200 --> 00:23:17,520
I can put it behind us.

343
00:23:17,600 --> 00:23:19,920
If you insist on settling the score,

344
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,200
don't force my hand.

345
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,240
Pay me.

346
00:23:26,840 --> 00:23:28,280
Do you not understand?

347
00:23:28,360 --> 00:23:30,000
I'm not giving you anything!

348
00:23:30,600 --> 00:23:32,720
Did your ledger record this?

349
00:23:32,800 --> 00:23:33,920
October 24th.

350
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:36,240
My last-minute overtime.

351
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:43,680
You added me
to Pan Jie's school parent group.

352
00:23:43,760 --> 00:23:47,080
You said checking homework
kept you from your beauty sleep.

353
00:23:49,160 --> 00:23:50,240
What's your point?

354
00:23:52,680 --> 00:23:54,520
If I can't get the money

355
00:23:54,600 --> 00:23:56,520
and can't find a new job nearby,

356
00:23:58,640 --> 00:23:59,800
I'll have to try here.

357
00:24:18,280 --> 00:24:20,280
LIYUAN BUILDING 9

358
00:24:25,760 --> 00:24:27,880
Zheng Yu.

359
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:37,840
Hello? Sorry, I didn't check my phone.

360
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:41,400
I have translated two-thirds
of the document you wanted.

361
00:24:43,120 --> 00:24:44,440
Tomorrow?

362
00:24:44,520 --> 00:24:46,240
I don't think that's feasible.

363
00:24:46,320 --> 00:24:47,920
My laptop isn't working.

364
00:24:50,560 --> 00:24:52,720
Okay, I'll send it to you in a bit.

365
00:24:53,520 --> 00:24:54,560
Thank you.

366
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:07,560
Does Jiang Haixing know
you came to see me?

367
00:25:08,600 --> 00:25:10,720
He's drinking at a friend's place tonight.

368
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:12,480
In this exam,

369
00:25:13,480 --> 00:25:15,000
I ranked second in my grade.

370
00:25:16,480 --> 00:25:17,600
I improved.

371
00:25:18,600 --> 00:25:19,440
That's great.

372
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:22,320
Zheng Yu,

373
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:24,720
how have you been lately?

374
00:25:26,440 --> 00:25:27,640
The same as usual.

375
00:25:29,880 --> 00:25:33,760
I didn't go to the hospital this semester,
afraid Jiang Haixing would find out.

376
00:25:34,560 --> 00:25:36,200
His nose is sharper than a dog's.

377
00:25:36,800 --> 00:25:40,480
Last time, he smelled
the disinfectant on me

378
00:25:40,560 --> 00:25:42,080
and went mad at the hospital.

379
00:25:42,960 --> 00:25:44,680
Does he treat you well?

380
00:25:44,760 --> 00:25:46,360
Do you have enough money?

381
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:48,640
It's all right.

382
00:25:49,360 --> 00:25:50,960
Whenever I need something,

383
00:25:51,040 --> 00:25:53,080
I tell him, and he buys it for me.

384
00:25:56,240 --> 00:25:58,240
He's afraid you will give me the money.

385
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:01,880
Are there too many hospital bills?

386
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:05,160
Or did those people come to Qingyi?

387
00:26:05,840 --> 00:26:07,280
No.

388
00:26:07,360 --> 00:26:08,400
Go home and rest.

389
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:09,480
I have things to do.

390
00:26:09,560 --> 00:26:11,280
Zheng Yu, wait.

391
00:26:13,360 --> 00:26:15,680
Did you bring your laptop?

392
00:26:23,880 --> 00:26:27,560
JIANG HAIXING DIGITAL REPAIR

393
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:34,240
Where have you been?

394
00:26:34,320 --> 00:26:35,760
I went to see a classmate.

395
00:26:35,840 --> 00:26:37,000
What classmate?

396
00:26:37,080 --> 00:26:38,200
Our academic rep.

397
00:26:38,280 --> 00:26:41,000
I borrowed study materials
and also got dinner.

398
00:26:41,080 --> 00:26:41,920
What subject?

399
00:26:48,720 --> 00:26:49,840
Physics.

400
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:52,760
Physics, okay.

401
00:26:52,840 --> 00:26:54,480
I was good at physics.

402
00:26:55,160 --> 00:26:56,080
Listen up.

403
00:26:56,680 --> 00:26:58,960
Don't go where you shouldn't go.

404
00:26:59,040 --> 00:27:00,840
You're my son.

405
00:27:00,920 --> 00:27:03,400
My son shouldn't be filial to others.

406
00:27:03,480 --> 00:27:04,640
Got it?

407
00:27:06,720 --> 00:27:09,400
This laptop isn't working.
Can you take a look?

408
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:11,440
Whose is it? The academic rep?

409
00:27:12,360 --> 00:27:15,520
He needs it repaired,
and since I'm borrowing his materials,

410
00:27:15,600 --> 00:27:17,280
I brought it for you to check.

411
00:27:18,760 --> 00:27:19,960
ON CHEN YANZHOU

412
00:27:20,040 --> 00:27:22,200
This is frozen.

413
00:27:22,280 --> 00:27:24,000
"On Chen Yanzhou"?

414
00:27:26,800 --> 00:27:28,920
My classmate's name is Chen Yanzhou.

415
00:27:30,520 --> 00:27:32,800
This is quite old.

416
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:35,200
Is there water damage? It could be fried.

417
00:27:35,800 --> 00:27:38,120
No, and he doesn't know what happened.

418
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:41,040
It's okay if you can't fix it.

419
00:27:41,120 --> 00:27:44,000
It is very old. I shouldn't have
told him you could fix it.

420
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:46,960
I'll just give it back to him.

421
00:27:47,040 --> 00:27:48,240
Child,

422
00:27:48,320 --> 00:27:50,040
I didn't say I couldn't fix it.

423
00:27:50,120 --> 00:27:51,680
I have to open it up.

424
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:54,040
How much will it cost?

425
00:27:55,120 --> 00:27:56,240
I'll tell him.

426
00:27:57,560 --> 00:28:00,000
You're fixing it for your classmate.

427
00:28:00,080 --> 00:28:02,800
Asking for repair fees
will make us look so stingy.

428
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:07,200
Establish good relationships
with these top students.

429
00:28:07,280 --> 00:28:10,080
If you ever have difficulties,
they can help you out.

430
00:28:10,760 --> 00:28:12,600
These are social skills.

431
00:28:12,680 --> 00:28:14,040
I'll go do homework now.

432
00:28:15,840 --> 00:28:17,440
You're so forgetful.

433
00:28:17,520 --> 00:28:19,760
FAST REPAIRS OF PHONES AND DIGITAL DEVICES

434
00:28:52,800 --> 00:28:53,760
Coming.

435
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:58,360
Hi, I'm the tutor who was referred by
the Mingsi Training Agency.

436
00:28:58,440 --> 00:28:59,840
My name is Zheng Yu.

437
00:29:00,360 --> 00:29:01,600
Wait.

438
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:02,640
Sorry.

439
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:08,600
Here.

440
00:29:13,360 --> 00:29:15,920
Why are you standing there?
Change into slippers.

441
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:18,440
Your feet will freeze in those thin shoes.

442
00:29:24,360 --> 00:29:25,560
Come in.

443
00:29:29,120 --> 00:29:30,040
Thank you.

444
00:29:39,520 --> 00:29:41,640
They're my daughter's and are a bit small.

445
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:43,000
Bear with them for now.

446
00:29:44,520 --> 00:29:47,160
I read the resume that the agent sent.

447
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:48,720
I'm very satisfied.

448
00:29:48,800 --> 00:29:51,040
Unfortunately, I don't get the last say.

449
00:29:51,640 --> 00:29:53,400
Spend some time with my daughter.

450
00:29:53,480 --> 00:29:55,640
Whether we end up hiring you or not,

451
00:29:55,720 --> 00:29:58,440
I will still pay you for your time today.

452
00:29:58,520 --> 00:29:59,840
What is her name?

453
00:30:00,520 --> 00:30:02,560
Gao Xing, a first-year in senior high.

454
00:30:18,280 --> 00:30:20,400
Are you the new tutor?

455
00:30:38,680 --> 00:30:39,760
Open this for me.

456
00:30:47,240 --> 00:30:48,960
I forgot to say, it's carbonated.

457
00:30:49,040 --> 00:30:50,920
It will release carbon dioxide.

458
00:30:52,400 --> 00:30:53,760
Drink it, and let's begin.

459
00:31:10,400 --> 00:31:12,720
If you tutor me,
can you make me number one?

460
00:31:12,800 --> 00:31:15,360
What did you rank
in your finals this time?

461
00:31:16,680 --> 00:31:18,400
Thirty-fifth.

462
00:31:18,480 --> 00:31:19,960
- In your grade?
- In my class.

463
00:31:25,720 --> 00:31:27,520
Then I can't.

464
00:31:28,760 --> 00:31:31,360
Then this is the last lesson you give me.

465
00:31:54,440 --> 00:31:55,760
Ms. Xiaozheng.

466
00:31:58,040 --> 00:31:59,960
Did Gao Xing cause any trouble?

467
00:32:00,040 --> 00:32:00,960
No.

468
00:32:01,560 --> 00:32:04,160
That's good. I calculated the time.

469
00:32:05,160 --> 00:32:06,680
Is it not time yet?

470
00:32:06,760 --> 00:32:08,120
We started at 4:00 p.m. sharp.

471
00:32:08,960 --> 00:32:10,720
You went over by 20 minutes.

472
00:32:10,800 --> 00:32:12,280
Look, it's dark outside.

473
00:32:13,320 --> 00:32:16,040
I'll pay you one-third more
based on your hourly rate.

474
00:32:18,240 --> 00:32:19,680
All right, sent.

475
00:32:21,960 --> 00:32:23,120
Also,

476
00:32:24,080 --> 00:32:25,320
regarding tutoring,

477
00:32:25,400 --> 00:32:27,600
I still need to ask Gao Xing
for her opinion.

478
00:32:27,680 --> 00:32:28,680
Let's keep in touch.

479
00:32:31,440 --> 00:32:32,680
I'll see you out.

480
00:32:41,040 --> 00:32:43,240
I'll throw this on my way out.

481
00:32:44,840 --> 00:32:46,040
Thank you.

482
00:32:49,640 --> 00:32:50,920
Be careful.

483
00:32:56,920 --> 00:32:57,960
The pizza is cold.

484
00:32:59,080 --> 00:33:00,160
I'll heat it up.

485
00:33:00,920 --> 00:33:02,280
What do you think of her?

486
00:33:03,200 --> 00:33:04,120
Nothing much.

487
00:33:15,680 --> 00:33:17,840
ZHENG YU, QING YI UNIVERSITY
COLLEGE OF LIFE SCIENCES

488
00:33:20,360 --> 00:33:21,520
GPA: 3.9 (TOP 5% OF MAJOR)

489
00:33:21,600 --> 00:33:23,680
NATIONAL SCHOLARSHIP RECIPIENT
VITALITY AWARD WINNER

490
00:33:25,560 --> 00:33:26,760
Gao Xing.

491
00:33:28,120 --> 00:33:30,520
I don't have time
to take you to school tomorrow.

492
00:33:30,600 --> 00:33:31,960
Can you go on your own?

493
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:34,960
Haven't I always?

494
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:44,120
ZHENG YU

495
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:47,200
HIGH SCHOOL AFFILIATED WITH
QING YI UNIVERSITY

496
00:33:47,280 --> 00:33:48,680
My bike is at school.

497
00:33:48,760 --> 00:33:50,120
I'll bike home today.

498
00:33:50,200 --> 00:33:52,600
You don't have to pick me up. Bye.

499
00:34:02,160 --> 00:34:03,240
Son!

500
00:34:04,240 --> 00:34:05,160
Slow down.

501
00:34:10,280 --> 00:34:13,080
It's winter. Your hands
will freeze when biking.

502
00:34:13,159 --> 00:34:14,719
I bought new gloves for you.

503
00:34:14,800 --> 00:34:17,159
They're made with the best fiber
and hand-knit.

504
00:34:17,239 --> 00:34:18,400
They're warm and soft.

505
00:34:18,480 --> 00:34:20,320
- Try them on.
- Okay.

506
00:34:21,199 --> 00:34:22,960
We're finally on break,

507
00:34:23,040 --> 00:34:25,679
but we have to come to school
to get our transcripts.

508
00:34:26,280 --> 00:34:28,840
Didn't you say you would
ask the teacher for leave?

509
00:34:28,920 --> 00:34:31,960
He didn't approve it
and insisted I come to school.

510
00:34:32,040 --> 00:34:33,360
He was so mysterious.

511
00:34:33,440 --> 00:34:37,320
I couldn't catch a cab during rush hour
and had to squeeze onto the bus.

512
00:34:37,400 --> 00:34:41,560
Not only were there no seats,
but the heater was down.

513
00:34:41,639 --> 00:34:43,639
Look how frozen my hands are.

514
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:50,400
Isn't that Jiang Mian
from Year 2, Class 8?

515
00:34:50,480 --> 00:34:53,000
That must be his dad next to him.

516
00:34:53,080 --> 00:34:54,440
Good, it fits well.

517
00:34:56,679 --> 00:35:00,120
Who else but me, your dad,
would care about you so much?

518
00:35:02,480 --> 00:35:04,400
Your good-for-nothing sister?

519
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:08,080
You'll be lucky
if she doesn't ruin your life.

520
00:35:10,760 --> 00:35:11,880
I'm going.

521
00:35:18,360 --> 00:35:19,520
Bye.

522
00:35:59,920 --> 00:36:04,080
<i>Good morning, teachers and students.</i>

523
00:36:04,160 --> 00:36:06,520
<i>- Another semester draws to an end.</i>
- Hey, Jiahuan.

524
00:36:06,600 --> 00:36:09,400
- Bring this in for me.
<i>- First, on behalf of the school…</i>

525
00:36:09,480 --> 00:36:10,720
Where are you going?

526
00:36:10,800 --> 00:36:12,280
Building good karma for exams.

527
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:16,560
<i>We sincerely thank all the teachers</i>
<i>who work tirelessly and selflessly.</i>

528
00:36:16,640 --> 00:36:20,240
<i>At the same time,</i>
<i>I want to extend my congratulations</i>

529
00:36:20,320 --> 00:36:22,800
<i>to all the students determined to succeed.</i>

530
00:36:22,880 --> 00:36:24,560
Hello. I'm looking for someone.

531
00:36:25,640 --> 00:36:26,560
Who are you looking for?

532
00:36:26,640 --> 00:36:30,280
<i>With a semester's worth</i>
<i>of hard work and sweat,</i>

533
00:36:30,360 --> 00:36:34,600
<i>you submitted an answer sheet for youth.</i>

534
00:36:35,440 --> 00:36:38,440
Aren't these your gloves?
You accidentally threw them away.

535
00:36:38,520 --> 00:36:40,600
<i>We will present awards to students…</i>

536
00:36:40,680 --> 00:36:42,040
"Accidentally," you said?

537
00:36:42,960 --> 00:36:47,560
I saw you and your dad outside just now.
Didn't he give these to you?

538
00:36:47,640 --> 00:36:50,280
Be more careful
when throwing trash from now on.

539
00:36:50,360 --> 00:36:53,880
- Don't try to look cool.
<i>- </i>I didn't want--

540
00:36:53,960 --> 00:36:56,360
<i>Next, we have a special commendation.</i>

541
00:36:56,440 --> 00:37:01,320
<i>Year 1, Class 5's Gao Xing</i>
<i>found lost items six times this semester</i>

542
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:04,240
<i>and returned them to their owners</i>

543
00:37:04,320 --> 00:37:06,040
<i>or to the Lost and Found counter,</i>

544
00:37:06,120 --> 00:37:09,000
<i>bringing positive energy to our campus.</i>

545
00:37:09,080 --> 00:37:11,320
<i>For this, we hereby award</i>
<i>the Special Award for Civic Virtue.</i>

546
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:14,000
No wonder he insisted I come to school.

547
00:37:14,080 --> 00:37:15,640
<i>Students who won an award,</i>

548
00:37:15,720 --> 00:37:18,240
<i>proceed to Conference Room 201</i>
<i>in the administration building</i>

549
00:37:18,320 --> 00:37:21,560
<i>to collect your certificate</i>
<i>and take a commemorative photo.</i>

550
00:37:22,360 --> 00:37:23,760
You're welcome.

551
00:37:37,040 --> 00:37:40,560
DUAN SHENGYANG

552
00:37:40,640 --> 00:37:42,680
<i>Zheng Yu, I heard from Mingsi's agent</i>

553
00:37:42,760 --> 00:37:44,440
<i>that you interviewed two days ago.</i>

554
00:37:44,520 --> 00:37:46,320
<i>He said it's close to campus.</i>

555
00:37:46,400 --> 00:37:47,680
<i>It's a good fit for you.</i>

556
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:53,120
<i>Thank you for your help.</i>

557
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:55,760
You didn't come these past two days.

558
00:37:55,840 --> 00:37:57,800
So you went to an interview.

559
00:37:59,440 --> 00:38:00,760
How did it go?

560
00:38:01,600 --> 00:38:02,560
My chances are low.

561
00:38:03,200 --> 00:38:04,360
Why?

562
00:38:06,160 --> 00:38:09,800
The parent was too normal.
Such good things don't happen to me.

563
00:38:11,200 --> 00:38:12,400
It's too soon to say.

564
00:38:12,480 --> 00:38:14,320
Not hearing back yet is normal.

565
00:38:23,840 --> 00:38:25,160
LU SIQUAN (STORE MANAGER)

566
00:38:25,240 --> 00:38:29,080
<i>Last time, you said you could</i>
<i>arrange more shifts for me.</i>

567
00:38:34,160 --> 00:38:36,560
I think I've gained weight recently!

568
00:38:38,120 --> 00:38:39,920
- You haven't.
- Nonsense.

569
00:38:40,960 --> 00:38:42,560
My old folding bed

570
00:38:42,640 --> 00:38:45,560
sinks to the ground when I lie down on it.

571
00:38:45,640 --> 00:38:46,960
Either I've gained weight,

572
00:38:47,040 --> 00:38:49,920
or it's not able
to sustain weight anymore.

573
00:38:50,640 --> 00:38:52,200
Luckily, I bought a new one.

574
00:38:52,280 --> 00:38:54,520
It's quite comfortable.

575
00:38:54,600 --> 00:38:56,120
You can take the old bed.

576
00:38:56,200 --> 00:38:57,520
Use it.

577
00:38:57,600 --> 00:38:59,400
It would be a shame to toss it.

578
00:38:59,480 --> 00:39:03,280
You're skinny.
It can definitely bear your weight.

579
00:39:08,240 --> 00:39:09,520
Why are you looking at me?

580
00:39:09,600 --> 00:39:12,440
It was your friend who helped me

581
00:39:12,520 --> 00:39:15,080
carry the new bed to this ward.

582
00:39:16,000 --> 00:39:16,840
My friend?

583
00:39:18,200 --> 00:39:19,040
Xiaochen.

584
00:39:20,640 --> 00:39:21,880
Chen Yanzhou?

585
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:23,680
Has he been here?

586
00:39:25,040 --> 00:39:27,000
He seems to care about you a lot.

587
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:30,880
It's guilt.

588
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:32,400
Guilt?

589
00:39:33,480 --> 00:39:34,960
What has he done?

590
00:39:35,600 --> 00:39:37,240
He hasn't done anything wrong.

591
00:39:38,120 --> 00:39:41,200
He's just like every other kind person
who doesn't lack money.

592
00:39:42,080 --> 00:39:43,360
When they see me,

593
00:39:44,160 --> 00:39:46,320
they can't turn a blind eye

594
00:39:46,400 --> 00:39:47,640
or feel at peace.

595
00:39:53,240 --> 00:39:56,280
PREVIEW

596
00:39:59,400 --> 00:40:01,680
MAIN POINTS AND RESEARCH DISCOVERIES

597
00:40:01,760 --> 00:40:04,640
The cell proportion is
significantly higher than traditional…

598
00:40:05,920 --> 00:40:06,760
It just ended.

599
00:40:10,240 --> 00:40:11,080
What could I do?

600
00:40:11,160 --> 00:40:13,600
I just listened to her humiliate me.

601
00:40:14,520 --> 00:40:17,200
She's the boss. I'm just a lowly worker.

602
00:40:18,120 --> 00:40:19,400
What director?

603
00:40:20,440 --> 00:40:21,600
Less than trash!

604
00:40:26,040 --> 00:40:27,120
No.

605
00:40:27,800 --> 00:40:29,640
Let me tell you, I'm not drunk.

606
00:40:29,720 --> 00:40:31,320
If I were drunk, I would've hit her!

607
00:40:31,400 --> 00:40:32,920
Okay, bye.

608
00:41:24,280 --> 00:41:26,600
WU FA

609
00:41:34,120 --> 00:41:34,960
Ring me up!

610
00:41:49,680 --> 00:41:50,800
Ninety-eight yuan.

611
00:42:19,080 --> 00:42:20,760
Arrogant, are you?

612
00:42:21,920 --> 00:42:23,600
Got something to say?

613
00:42:23,680 --> 00:42:24,960
What's that look for?

614
00:42:25,560 --> 00:42:26,760
Are you mad?
